  "limitations": [
    "All grades are provisional browser assessments based on the supplied screenshots and runtime narrative; no independent interaction or file inspection was performed.",
    "Corresponding transition captures were assessed with their settled screens; static frames cannot establish animation continuity or absence of transient layout shifts.",
    "Reported browser checks support target size, contrast, focus, reflow and reduced motion, but were not independently reproduced.",
    "Content outside a screenshot is not automatically inaccessible; the reported full layout sweep supports scrolling, so no hard gate is asserted solely from viewport cropping.",
    "Physical iPhone, VoiceOver, native keyboard, Dynamic Type, microphone, haptics, payments and OS sharing remain unverified; these scores do not certify native 9/10 quality.",
    "Online Circles, production authentication and production cloud behavior are not demonstrated by the pictured offline state.",
    "Export-state images explicitly retained from round 27 are supporting evidence for reportedly unchanged code, not newly observed round-28 interactions.",
    "Synthetic layout readings and source descriptions were assessed for presentation only, not production copy quality, factual validity or predictive accuracy.",
    "No novice-user study is supplied, and screenshot evidence cannot establish an exemplary outcome score.",
    "The authorized threshold is not met: many screen and component aesthetic or functional means remain below 9; no confirmed hard-gate failure is established by this evidence."
  ],
  "topFixes": [
    "Compact 200% layouts by reducing decorative height and excess spacing, especially Home, birthday forms, Sky, check-in and sharing.",
    "Standardize secondary actions and distinguish navigation chevrons from inline disclosures.",
    "Make long evidence easier to scan with explicit context, assumptions and background section labels.",
    "Bring share-image text equivalents and download controls closer to the preview.",
    "Make explicit focus skipping consistently discoverable after selection and keep enlarged form recovery actions near their fields.",
    "Preserve the strong contextual error, saved-state and export feedback while obtaining independent browser and subsequent physical accessibility evidence."
  ]
}
